WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.034 --> 00:00:02.368
-Good evening.
I'm Seth Meyers.

00:00:02.368 --> 00:00:03.769
This is "Late Night."
We hope you're doing well.

00:00:03.769 --> 00:00:05.338
And now, if you don't mind,
we're gonna get to the news.

00:00:05.338 --> 00:00:07.840
Ohio Congressman Jim Jordan

00:00:07.840 --> 00:00:09.508
failed to secure
enough votes today

00:00:09.508 --> 00:00:11.911
in the second round of voting
to become House Speaker,

00:00:11.911 --> 00:00:14.580
and received only 199 votes.

00:00:14.580 --> 00:00:16.749
That's worse
than he did yesterday.

00:00:16.749 --> 00:00:18.017
If they keep doing votes,

00:00:18.017 --> 00:00:20.019
he's eventually
gonna get to zero.

00:00:20.019 --> 00:00:23.490
And then he'll fade away like
Marty McFly in a family photo.

00:00:23.490 --> 00:00:24.657
[ Laughter ]

00:00:24.657 --> 00:00:25.992
The White House announced
last night

00:00:25.992 --> 00:00:28.027
that President Biden's
scheduled stop in Jordan

00:00:28.027 --> 00:00:29.428
has been canceled,

00:00:29.428 --> 00:00:32.765
making it the second Jordan
to get shut down this week.

00:00:32.765 --> 00:00:34.567
[ Laughter ]

00:00:34.567 --> 00:00:36.435
President Biden arrived
this morning in Israel,

00:00:36.435 --> 00:00:38.638
making him the first president
to visit Israel

00:00:38.638 --> 00:00:41.207
during a time of war,
which is pretty dangerous.

00:00:41.207 --> 00:00:44.544
But he should be okay once
he makes it down the stairs.

00:00:44.544 --> 00:00:46.579
[ Laughter ]

00:00:48.715 --> 00:00:51.384
The Treasury Department
announced new sanctions today

00:00:51.384 --> 00:00:53.887
against 10 entities
that are linked to Hamas,

00:00:53.887 --> 00:00:57.890
including the cryptocurrency
firm Buy Cash.

00:00:57.890 --> 00:01:01.361
Oh, uh, was a cryptocurrency
firm up to no good?

00:01:01.361 --> 00:01:02.961
[ Laughter ]

00:01:02.961 --> 00:01:04.797
And it's called Buy Cash?

00:01:04.797 --> 00:01:07.734
"Hey, what's a good
non-suspicious name

00:01:07.734 --> 00:01:09.068
for a crypto firm?

00:01:09.068 --> 00:01:11.004
How about Buy Cash?"

00:01:11.004 --> 00:01:12.005
[ Laughter ]

00:01:12.005 --> 00:01:13.839
If I drove past a strip mall

00:01:13.839 --> 00:01:17.177
and there was a store
called Buy Cash,

00:01:17.177 --> 00:01:20.179
I would lock my doors
and call the police.

00:01:20.179 --> 00:01:21.314
[ Laughter ]

00:01:21.314 --> 00:01:23.816
Florida Congresswoman
Anna Paulina Luna

00:01:23.816 --> 00:01:25.885
reportedly brought
her newborn baby

00:01:25.885 --> 00:01:27.587
to yesterday's
House Speaker vote.

00:01:27.587 --> 00:01:29.622
Well, congratulations
to the new mom

00:01:29.622 --> 00:01:31.824
and the new Speaker!

00:01:31.824 --> 00:01:33.660
[ Laughter ]

00:01:33.660 --> 00:01:36.329
Baby with a gavel!
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:36.329 --> 00:01:38.064
Baby with a gavel.

00:01:39.765 --> 00:01:42.434
That's one of comedy's
first rules.

00:01:42.434 --> 00:01:45.437
Can't go wrong with a baby
with a gavel.

00:01:45.437 --> 00:01:47.774
Former President Trump yesterday
attacked the judge

00:01:47.774 --> 00:01:49.675
overseeing
his civil fraud trial,

00:01:49.675 --> 00:01:51.444
in a post on Truth Social,

00:01:51.444 --> 00:01:54.714
and said he's serving "as judge,
jury, and everything else."

00:01:54.714 --> 00:01:57.382
I'm guessing this was after
three failed attempts

00:01:57.382 --> 00:01:59.552
to spell executioner.

00:01:59.552 --> 00:02:01.621
[ Laughter ]

00:02:03.623 --> 00:02:07.026
[As Trump] Judge, jury,
and big guy with ax and mask.

00:02:07.026 --> 00:02:09.695
[ Laughter ]

00:02:09.695 --> 00:02:11.030
-[Normal voice] That's right.

00:02:11.030 --> 00:02:13.265
Trump attacked the judge
overseeing his civil fraud trial

00:02:13.265 --> 00:02:15.835
despite being under
a partial gag order.

00:02:15.835 --> 00:02:17.169
Yeah, I don't think you can...

00:02:17.169 --> 00:02:18.504
Yeah, don't...
[ Gibberish ]

00:02:18.504 --> 00:02:20.240
[Bleep]

00:02:20.240 --> 00:02:22.441
I know, I stumbled
on the wording earlier,

00:02:22.441 --> 00:02:24.677
and I didn't rewrite it,
and it's my fault.

00:02:24.677 --> 00:02:26.945
Okay, here we go.
Alright. Yeah.

00:02:26.945 --> 00:02:29.381
Let's go back and take it again.
It's definitely...

00:02:29.381 --> 00:02:31.017
This isn't gonna
throw it at all.

00:02:31.017 --> 00:02:32.518
[ Laughter ]

00:02:32.518 --> 00:02:35.521
I don't -- I don't even think
they've noticed I flubbed up.

00:02:35.521 --> 00:02:37.857
[ Laughter ]

00:02:37.857 --> 00:02:40.393
I've played it so smoothly.

00:02:40.393 --> 00:02:42.561
[ Laughter ]

00:02:42.561 --> 00:02:44.397
That's right.
Trump attacked the judge

00:02:44.397 --> 00:02:45.898
overseeing his civil fraud trial

00:02:45.898 --> 00:02:47.600
despite being under
a partial gag order.

00:02:47.600 --> 00:02:49.802
Yeah, you don't think
you can shut Trump up

00:02:49.802 --> 00:02:52.171
with a partial gag order,
do you?

00:02:52.171 --> 00:02:54.440
You can't even shut him up
with a full gag order.

00:02:54.440 --> 00:02:57.610
You could put them in the full
Hannibal Lecter outfit,

00:02:57.610 --> 00:03:00.279
and he would still find a way
to get the word out.

00:03:00.279 --> 00:03:02.448
[ Laughter ]

00:03:02.448 --> 00:03:05.618
In an effort to reduce pollution
caused by microplastics,

00:03:05.618 --> 00:03:09.789
a European Union ban on the sale
of loose plastic glitter

00:03:09.789 --> 00:03:11.424
went into effect this week.

00:03:11.424 --> 00:03:13.259
Some great news that, sadly,

00:03:13.259 --> 00:03:15.261
there was no way to celebrate.

00:03:15.261 --> 00:03:17.397
[ Laughter ]

00:03:21.234 --> 00:03:23.570
United Airlines
has reportedly decided

00:03:23.570 --> 00:03:25.738
to implement
a new boarding strategy

00:03:25.738 --> 00:03:29.742
that allows economy passengers
in window seats to board first.

00:03:29.742 --> 00:03:31.277
Meanwhile, Spirit Airlines

00:03:31.277 --> 00:03:33.212
has decided
to streamline boarding

00:03:33.212 --> 00:03:35.048
with a starting gun.

00:03:35.048 --> 00:03:37.050
[ Laughter ]

00:03:39.151 --> 00:03:42.922
The US Mint yesterday announced
that journalist Ida B. Wells

00:03:42.922 --> 00:03:44.924
will be honored
with her face on a quarter.

00:03:44.924 --> 00:03:46.458
Because what greater honor

00:03:46.458 --> 00:03:48.294
than being bounced
into a Solo cup

00:03:48.294 --> 00:03:50.096
by a drunk freshman?

00:03:50.096 --> 00:03:51.764
[ Laughter ]

00:03:51.764 --> 00:03:53.533
And finally, Netflix recently
unveiled plans

00:03:53.533 --> 00:03:55.067
for its first
live sports event,

00:03:55.067 --> 00:03:57.536
which will feature
Formula One drivers and golfers

00:03:57.536 --> 00:03:59.872
teaming up to compete
in a golf tournament.

00:03:59.872 --> 00:04:02.641
So, if you love the intense,
high-speed excitement

00:04:02.641 --> 00:04:05.644
of Formula One racing,
get ready to strap yourself in

00:04:05.644 --> 00:04:07.146
for some golf.

00:04:07.146 --> 00:04:08.147
[ Laughter ]

00:04:08.147 --> 00:04:09.815
And that was a monologue,
everybody!

00:04:09.815 --> 00:04:12.218
We are off and running.

